				</label>
				<input type="submit" class="search-submit" value="Search" />
			</form></section><section id="text-2" class="widget widget_text">			<div class="textwidget"><p class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" style="text-align: center;" data-start="530" data-end="565"><strong data-start="530" data-end="565">What is The Adventurer Leagues?</strong></p>
<p data-start="570" data-end="746">The Adventurer Leagues is a community of Dungeons &amp; Dragons players, Dungeon Masters, and adventurers built around bringing people together to play, share, and enjoy the hobby.</p>
<p data-start="751" data-end="920">We host Adventurers League official organized play games, community events, and more.  All of it centered around a welcoming and active Discord community for <em><span style="text-decoration: underline;">everyone</span></em>.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;" data-start="925" data-end="961"><strong data-start="925" data-end="961">New to TAL?<br />
<a href="https://discord.gg/taldnd">You&#8217;re welcome here!</a></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center;" data-start="925" data-end="961"><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter  wp-image-488" src="https://theadventurerleagues.com/vault/2020/12/TAL-Logo-Icon-300x300.png" alt="TAL Detwenti Tavern Logo" width="251" height="251" srcset="https://theadventurerleagues.com/vault/2020/12/TAL-Logo-Icon-300x300.png 300w, https://theadventurerleagues.com/vault/2020/12/TAL-Logo-Icon-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://theadventurerleagues.com/vault/2020/12/TAL-Logo-Icon-150x150.png 150w, https://theadventurerleagues.com/vault/2020/12/TAL-Logo-Icon-768x768.png 768w, https://theadventurerleagues.com/vault/2020/12/TAL-Logo-Icon.png 1163w" sizes="(max-width: 251px) 100vw, 251px" /></p>
<p data-start="925" data-end="961">
</div>
		</section><section id="talwdw_discord_widget-3" class="widget widget_talwdw_discord_widget"><div class="talwdw-discord-card" style="--talwdw-bg-rgb:43,45,49;--talwdw-bg-opacity:0;--talwdw-border-rgb:255,255,255;--talwdw-border-opacity:0.12;--talwdw-border-width:2px;--talwdw-title-font:Trebuchet MS, Arial, sans-serif;--talwdw-title-color:#F2F3F5;--talwdw-subtitle-font:Georgia, serif;--talwdw-subtitle-color:#B5BAC1;--talwdw-server_name-font:Georgia, serif;--talwdw-server_name-color:#F2F3F5;--talwdw-online_label-font:Georgia, serif;--talwdw-online_label-color:#B5BAC1;--talwdw-button-font:Georgia, serif;--talwdw-button-color:#FFFFFF;--talwdw-members_heading-font:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--talwdw-members_heading-color:#949BA4;--talwdw-member_name-font:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--talwdw-member_name-color:#F2F3F5;--talwdw-activity-font:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--talwdw-activity-color:#949BA4;--talwdw-error_title-font:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--talwdw-error_title-color:#F2F3F5;--talwdw-error_text-font:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;--talwdw-error_text-color:#B5BAC1;">
	<div class="talwdw-discord-header">
		<div class="talwdw-discord-brand">
